    {
      "title": "Режим сигналов хранится в схеме",
      "text": "Повторный `up()` без опции `signals` режим не трогает — он остался `tenant`.",
      "code": "const r = await up({ dsn: dsn.admin, schema, quiet: true });\nreturn { signals: r.signals };",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> up</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ dsn: dsn.admin, schema, quiet: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { signals: r.signals };</span></span></code></pre>",
